{"text": "From: ea, Charisa, HSD\n\nTo: Savies, Sidonie, SD\n\u2018Subject: FW: Budget Negotiation\nDate: Saturday, October 29, 2011 9:26:47 AM\n\u2018Attachments: 1.102814 Cover Leiter NM pdt\n2A1O2BLL WMH Deloite Rationale oat\n102611 OHCR CHS Budoet Responses a\nSidonie,\n\nBrent, Brian, and | looked at this and made suggestions for the letter to show that requirements have yet\nto be identified.\n\nCharissa\n\nFrom: Derksen, Dan, HSD\nSent: Friday, October 28, 2011 4:23 PM\nTo: Saavedra, Charissa, HSD; Earnest, Brent, HSD; Earnest, Brent, HSD\nCe: Squier, Sidonie, HSD; Caverly, Priscilla, HSD; Pool, Jonni, HSD\nSubject: FW: Budget Negotiation\n\nBrent, Brian, Charis\nand forwarded th\n\na thank you for looking these over. I\u2019ve incorporated your suggestions\nwith the attachments to CMS. Have a nice weekend.\n\nDan Derksen MD, Director\nNM Office of Health Care Reform\n2009 S, Pacheco St/P.0. Box 2348,\nSanta Fe, NM 87508\n508-827-7750\nDan.Derksen(@state nm.us\n\nFrom: Derksen, Dan, HSD\nSent: Friday, October 28, 2011 4:06 PM.\nTo: \u2018Smith, Vivian (CMS/COO)'\nCc: Clark, Christopher A. (CMS/OAGM)\nSubject: RE: Budget Negotiation\n\nVivian Smith, Grant Management Specialist October 28\", 2011\nOffice of Acquisition and Grants Management\nCenter for Medicare and Medicaid Services\nU.S. Department of Health & Human Services\nVivian.Smith@hhs.gov\n\nDear Ms. Smith:\nIn response to your correspondence of 10/20/11, and budget negotiation telephone\nconference on 10/26/11, Deloitte has prepared a response to the request for more detail\nrelated to the IT component of the budget.\n\nAs detailed in the grant application, while HSD has contracted for the HSD eligibility IT\nsystem which includes Medicaid (ISD2R) with Deloitte, the detailed cost, requirements,\napplication design, timeframes, and deliverables for the HIX have not been completed.",
